{"w":2400,"h":2857,"lines":[{"t":"WOMAN:","x":0.19201817829460818,"y":0.10456090591217526,"w":0.055410010019938144,"h":0.010354932327217181,"c":1},{"y":0.13662790712069239,"w":0.036332181294759125,"t":"MAN:","h":0.010174418263205087,"c":1,"x":0.19204152172286265},{"h":0.01308139510051276,"w":0.055363318125406902,"t":"WOMAN:","c":1,"x":0.19204152480407857,"y":0.15116279065831917},{"y":0.16860465130807767,"w":0.036332181294759125,"h":0.010174418263205087,"c":1,"t":"MAN:","x":0.19204152171853739},{"y":0.214679529877982,"x":0.19364196151322177,"t":"WOMAN:","h":0.012501404951134276,"w":0.053892548878987617,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"x":0.19204152236084548,"y":0.24854651141259387,"w":0.034602076212565114,"t":"MAN:"},{"c":1,"h":0.011942388962998596,"y":0.27891252642821085,"x":0.19199524243036592,"w":0.05545588175455729,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"c":1,"x":0.27681660851945766,"y":0.10174418611100777,"w":0.5536332194010416,"h":0.015988371937820545,"t":"Right. And have you been to the new shopping centre outside Broadbeach yet,"},{"t":"Martyn?","y":0.11918604625680129,"c":1,"x":0.27681660883303666,"w":0.060553633371988935,"h":0.014534884186538477},{"h":0.016095171448565315,"c":1,"t":"Yes, once or twice. It's not that far from where I live.","x":0.27681660908209776,"y":0.13365990182359022,"w":0.3615916951497396},{"t":"It's a very modern-looking building, isn't it?","h":0.016140942476778442,"x":0.2750865015723416,"w":0.3027681732177735,"y":0.14970930239549607,"c":1},{"h":0.017585275888943541,"c":1,"t":"Yes, and it's lovely. The glass roof is certainly impressive. But my favourite thing","x":0.27681662570978743,"y":0.16410077006025892,"w":0.55017298380533863},{"w":0.51211074829101566,"y":0.18019594115461934,"h":0.017494751574527623,"t":"is the plants they've put around the building. They're amazing, and so big","c":1,"x":0.27508649465060103},{"x":0.27681660969593302,"w":0.058823528289794924,"c":1,"t":"already.","y":0.19767441889386994,"h":0.014534882851794939},{"x":0.27681663210257718,"c":1,"w":0.53633214314778654,"h":0.01761477305557102,"y":0.2120363891290965,"t":"And what about the entertainment facilities? Have you used any of them yet?"},{"c":1,"w":0.15397923787434897,"t":"Like the new cinema?","x":0.27508650554796332,"y":0.22953114075856418,"h":0.013296011196641033},{"h":0.019484987786134944,"c":1,"t":"Nah, not yet. I can't see any advantage in having it there because the one in","y":0.24350499287124183,"w":0.52783610026041672,"x":0.27674971721718045},{"y":0.25864052903479118,"c":1,"h":0.019912917268618213,"w":0.16512944539388025,"t":"town is actually bigger.","x":0.27473759798291286},{"h":0.01469559132260323,"c":1,"x":0.27854671622507782,"w":0.23183390299479162,"t":"OK, well thank you so much for...","y":0.2774667601830807},{"y":0.32841696070068194,"t":"PART 2","h":0.016131194844122509,"x":0.19202323336423069,"w":0.088271872202555307,"c":1},{"t":"Hello and welcome to this podcast telling you about our annual business exhibition. This","h":0.016129753988384787,"x":0.19204151844216863,"w":0.61418685913085935,"y":0.3575581396101476,"c":1},{"y":0.37354651139238104,"c":1,"x":0.19204153314671099,"h":0.014534884186538477,"w":0.55709340413411457,"t":"year, as always, it will be full of the very best speakers, features and innovations."},{"t":"Let me start by reading some feedback from James Craig, who's exhibited with us for the","y":0.39311059367643741,"w":0.62124079386393227,"x":0.1919744503965031,"h":0.01890962919711725,"c":1},{"t":"past two years. James says, ''m director of a company called TalkCon, which is an office","x":0.19194431885441143,"h":0.019371080098242288,"c":1,"w":0.61263076782226566,"y":0.40890641137420869},{"c":1,"w":0.61245676676432292,"x":0.19204151274004119,"y":0.42722183318324469,"t":"phone system. The first year we exhibited, we had a stand in the Business Village, where","h":0.016095171448565426},{"c":1,"t":"we made a lot of useful contacts. We also used the Breakout area where people could sit","x":0.19373317366400802,"y":0.44178106007219253,"w":0.61772333780924482,"h":0.015997628384824436},{"w":0.62456746419270825,"y":0.45930232534634818,"t":"down and relax, and try out our products, and due to popular request we used that again","h":0.014534884186538477,"x":0.19204152732336685,"c":1},{"w":0.6020761108398438,"c":1,"x":0.19377163307099116,"t":"last year. Last year we also sponsored the innovative Business Connections Zone where","y":0.47515745301053103,"h":0.013296011196641033},{"h":0.013107841043225377,"c":1,"x":0.19377163369353287,"t":"people could leave their contact details on a board to contact other companies, and that","y":0.49125262394687885,"w":0.61764704386393232},{"x":0.19199765109126324,"t":"also effectively raised our corporate profile. We're hoping that in the coming exhibition","w":0.60562489827473964,"y":0.50567288482897732,"h":0.017517030447658843,"c":1},{"h":0.017535120895311063,"y":0.52166902013199234,"t":"we also have a presence in the Digital Marketing centre, which is clearly a key area for our","c":1,"x":0.19199932171484174,"w":0.63676198323567701},{"y":0.53778866359355459,"h":0.016095171448565426,"x":0.19377163467872957,"c":1,"t":"company. And also maybe have our own Talkcon Zone, at some stage.'","w":0.49480967203776038},{"h":0.01469559132260323,"c":1,"x":0.19377163626338084,"y":0.55948215521050992,"w":0.61072662353515628,"t":"The exhibition's open from 8am to 11pm and there's a range of special events for you to"},{"x":0.19204152349796069,"t":"enjoy in the evening.","h":0.016095171448565426,"y":0.57557732696800146,"w":0.15051902770996098,"c":1},{"h":0.016101273896395596,"x":0.19204152159253168,"t":"As well as a unique chance to publicise your company, businesses who exhibit with us can","y":0.59727081904607393,"w":0.62283737182617194,"c":1},{"x":0.19197609134615645,"c":1,"y":0.61254439721135479,"t":"claim discounts on a number of popular brands, including major high street fashion and.","w":0.61257639567057298,"h":0.018288992100282564},{"w":0.61764704386393232,"t":"jewellery outlets, as well as grocery chains. Discounts available range from 3.5% up to an","y":0.62936046518479616,"h":0.015988371937820434,"x":0.19031142626420405,"c":1},{"w":0.61245676676432292,"y":0.64520643815928591,"h":0.016130771063023186,"c":1,"t":"amazing 15%, so you can save a lot of money. In fact, the average saving made by each","x":0.19204151272902512},{"y":0.66130160976017505,"x":0.19204151083155041,"w":0.63494812011718749,"h":0.016095171448565426,"t":"exhibitor came to over £400! The scheme is available to every member of your organisation","c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.014534884186538477,"x":0.19204152250807169,"t":"so this is a benefit that really does have something for you all.","y":0.67732558115742669,"w":0.43079584757486977},{"x":0.19377162045683793,"h":0.01469559132260323,"y":0.72078376489646134,"c":1,"w":0.5674740600585938,"t":"Now let me tell you about some of our keynote speakers for this year's exhibition."},{"x":0.19031141410512503,"c":1,"y":0.74273255821237782,"w":0.59861592610677095,"h":0.015988371937820434,"t":"Jim Clowrie started off selling vegetables from a small plot, then opened a small café."},{"y":0.75798500015437631,"w":0.6125704447428385,"x":0.19198254937425682,"h":0.01807256876129304,"c":1,"t":"Rather to his surprise this became a bit of a sensation, and in a remarkably short time he"},{"w":0.63494812011718749,"t":"had opened an amazing 76 restaurants worldwide. He'll be telling you how it all happened,","h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"y":0.77466759967097731,"x":0.19031140697493942},{"y":0.81245626288584505,"h":0.01469559132260323,"x":0.19377162541305873,"t":"David France will be giving an inspirational talk about how as a business-minded teenager","w":0.62283737182617194,"c":1},{"h":0.017627134116234844,"c":1,"w":0.61256520589192709,"y":0.82782449330630392,"x":0.19372171737566807,"t":"he managed to set up his own company, and even to be the first person under 18 to get"},{"y":0.84447674395116601,"w":0.62283737182617194,"c":1,"h":0.014534884186538477,"t":"a business bank account. David's company has gone from strength to strength but he isn't","x":0.19377162542008258},{"w":0.63667821248372403,"c":1,"t":"just interested in making money - he also makes regular donations to organisations helping","h":0.016095171448565426,"x":0.19031141269592525,"y":0.86039188230876273},{"y":0.87645348849051774,"h":0.013081395100512871,"w":0.39965398152669274,"c":1,"x":0.19204152134206856,"t":"those in need both in the UK and elsewhere in the world."},{"t":"Test 4","c":1,"x":0.86143025862645362,"y":0.051946068761658082,"w":0.057416299184163466,"h":0.018200885673934075},{"x":0.85467127999391246,"y":0.18168604658547705,"h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1,"t":"09","w":0.024221453666687043},{"w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.01308139510051276,"x":0.85467128078429555,"y":0.22965116288043519,"t":"Q10","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.44476744165546722,"t":"Q11\/12","x":0.85294117758305066,"w":0.057093423207600913,"h":0.011627907349230693},{"y":0.47529069777677835,"w":0.057093423207600913,"c":1,"h":0.013081395100512871,"t":"Q11\/12","x":0.85294117758593413},{"w":0.055363324483235665,"c":1,"h":0.01308139510051276,"t":"Q13\/14","y":0.61482558149841204,"x":0.85294117504490963},{"c":1,"x":0.85294117504490963,"w":0.055363324483235665,"t":"Q13\/14","y":0.66279069777748179,"h":0.013081395100512871},{"x":0.85294117697326122,"t":"Q15","y":0.76162790675820113,"w":0.032871971130371103,"c":1,"h":0.011627907349230804},{"t":"113","x":0.87889273407149249,"c":1,"h":0.01308139510051276,"w":0.032871971130371103,"y":0.95494186055080377}]}